1
00:00:00,023 --> 00:00:01,469
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,472 --> 00:00:02,996
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,215 --> 00:00:04,215
(Episode 38)

4
00:00:04,218 --> 00:00:05,218
Ji Ni.

5
00:00:07,108 --> 00:00:08,108
Here.

6
00:00:14,712 --> 00:00:16,209
You were right. Do Hee took it.

7
00:00:17,352 --> 00:00:19,665
I'm sorry I didn't believe you.

8
00:00:23,438 --> 00:00:24,792
I found it at Do Hee's house,

9
00:00:24,852 --> 00:00:28,076
but she still doesn't know I found it.

10
00:00:31,092 --> 00:00:33,129
Ji Ni, what should we do?
Should we confront her?

11
00:00:33,185 --> 00:00:35,198
I'll be your witness. I found it myself.

12
00:00:38,395 --> 00:00:39,468
I'll wait.

13
00:00:39,576 --> 00:00:40,734
Wait for what?

14
00:00:40,792 --> 00:00:43,056
She must've stolen it for a reason.

15
00:00:43,632 --> 00:00:44,824
We'll find out soon...

16
00:00:45,252 --> 00:00:47,362
why she did all this.

17
00:00:49,565 --> 00:00:51,947
Then I'll forgive her as I see fit.

18
00:00:55,778 --> 00:00:57,943
I'm sorry I dragged you into this too.

19
00:00:58,932 --> 00:01:02,368
She's the CEO's future daughter-in-law
and your friend's fiancée.

20
00:01:02,425 --> 00:01:04,688
I hope Ji Hu breaks up with her.

21
00:01:05,212 --> 00:01:07,852
No reason could ever excuse what she did.

22
00:01:09,938 --> 00:01:11,675
Do Do Hee has a powerful father.

23
00:01:11,990 --> 00:01:15,480
She always gets away with everything
because he covers for her.

24
00:01:15,615 --> 00:01:17,447
That's why she thinks
she can behave this way.

25
00:01:18,872 --> 00:01:20,178
My parents tried...

26
00:01:20,726 --> 00:01:23,171
to prove Do Hee was
behind the school bullying...

27
00:01:24,691 --> 00:01:25,919
but they couldn't in the end.

28
00:01:26,412 --> 00:01:27,733
I see.

29
00:01:28,603 --> 00:01:29,636
My dad...

30
00:01:30,811 --> 00:01:33,040
tried to fight it to the very end...

31
00:01:34,688 --> 00:01:37,201
but there was no evidence,
and no witnesses came forward.

32
00:01:37,445 --> 00:01:39,218
But I'm here now.

33
00:01:39,646 --> 00:01:40,758
I'll be your witness.

34
00:01:41,726 --> 00:01:42,763
I'll handle it myself.

35
00:01:43,390 --> 00:01:44,415
Don't worry.

36
00:02:00,009 --> 00:02:01,342
I know it still needs work.

37
00:02:01,571 --> 00:02:04,789
But I made it in case
it could be useful to you, Father.

38
00:02:04,812 --> 00:02:08,204
I had no idea you were this talented.

39
00:02:08,405 --> 00:02:10,389
- This is impressive.
- Really?

40
00:02:10,784 --> 00:02:13,906
Father, you're not just saying that
to encourage me, are you?

41
00:02:13,908 --> 00:02:16,241
No, I separate work
from personal relationships.

42
00:02:16,244 --> 00:02:18,149
Father, I'm so happy.

43
00:02:18,372 --> 00:02:20,635
Does that mean you'll use my idea?

44
00:02:20,937 --> 00:02:23,328
I thought Ji Ni was a genius.

45
00:02:23,958 --> 00:02:25,805
Is everyone this talented these days?

46
00:02:25,958 --> 00:02:27,300
Or just you...

47
00:02:29,214 --> 00:02:30,786
I'm kidding.

48
00:02:30,984 --> 00:02:32,756
Ji Ni is definitely a genius.

49
00:02:32,772 --> 00:02:33,972
I could never match her.

50
00:02:34,022 --> 00:02:35,472
You're so humble.

51
00:02:36,552 --> 00:02:40,020
But I sincerely wanted
to help you, Father,

52
00:02:40,022 --> 00:02:41,704
so the ideas just came to me.

53
00:02:42,211 --> 00:02:44,770
I guess art really comes
from the heart, Father.

54
00:02:44,773 --> 00:02:45,773
What?

55
00:02:49,632 --> 00:02:51,941
What did you say
to make him laugh like that?

56
00:02:53,049 --> 00:02:54,938
It was nothing.

57
00:02:55,299 --> 00:02:56,346
Excuse me.

58
00:02:59,197 --> 00:03:00,197
What made you laugh?

59
00:03:00,924 --> 00:03:02,309
Well, that's...

60
00:03:06,399 --> 00:03:07,908
They must be praising me, right?

61
00:03:19,071 --> 00:03:20,882
I told Mrs. Kim...

62
00:03:20,890 --> 00:03:23,635
how hard you were working
to support Mr. Im's business.

63
00:03:23,637 --> 00:03:24,637
I did well, right?

64
00:03:25,224 --> 00:03:26,497
Yes, thank you.

65
00:03:27,738 --> 00:03:30,304
That skincare you gave me was wonderful.

66
00:03:30,313 --> 00:03:33,600
Look. My skin is so smooth now.

67
00:03:34,518 --> 00:03:36,306
Keep helping me,
and there'll be more gifts.

68
00:03:39,647 --> 00:03:42,932
I thought Do Hee did nothing but play,
but she can really draw.

69
00:03:44,412 --> 00:03:47,798
If she's this good, fire Ji Ni
and hire Do Hee instead.

70
00:03:48,393 --> 00:03:49,458
What's the problem?

71
00:03:49,552 --> 00:03:52,284
It wouldn't be proper to employ
the ambassador's daughter.

72
00:03:53,158 --> 00:03:56,458
I was going to open a large bookstore
for her after the wedding.

73
00:03:56,666 --> 00:03:57,954
That's true, but...

74
00:03:58,643 --> 00:04:00,365
you'd still employ a mistress's daughter?

75
00:04:00,490 --> 00:04:02,898
If the ambassador found out,
he'd think even less of us.

76
00:04:03,489 --> 00:04:05,824
Just fire her
and give Do Hee her position.

77
00:04:06,147 --> 00:04:08,800
If you help her build a career
and open a large bookstore for her,

78
00:04:09,139 --> 00:04:10,647
imagine how pleased he'd be.

79
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:14,124
- Right.
- But Ji Hu...

80
00:04:16,531 --> 00:04:20,755
Tell him to stop dragging this out
and decide whether he's going to London.

81
00:04:20,943 --> 00:04:23,452
I heard Do Hee's mom even booked
first-class tickets.

82
00:04:24,147 --> 00:04:26,783
Mother, don't you have
a gathering tonight?

83
00:04:27,695 --> 00:04:30,247
It's unbearably hot,
but they want to go to Nam San.

84
00:04:30,492 --> 00:04:32,678
Apparently, a famous chef opened
a restaurant there.

85
00:04:33,612 --> 00:04:36,055
I heard you've been hiding your talent.

86
00:04:36,214 --> 00:04:39,812
- Father was really impressed.
- It was nothing.

87
00:04:41,014 --> 00:04:42,312
You actually drew them?

88
00:04:43,144 --> 00:04:44,669
Yes. Surprised, right?

89
00:04:45,301 --> 00:04:48,791
I drew them in secret
because you kept underestimating me.

90
00:04:49,279 --> 00:04:51,923
- You don't even know the concept.
- I looked into it.

91
00:04:52,092 --> 00:04:54,884
I saw part of the draft
Il Dong was carrying.

92
00:04:55,515 --> 00:04:57,944
Ji Ni's drawings lacked imagination.

93
00:04:58,408 --> 00:05:00,321
So I made mine more creative.

94
00:05:00,492 --> 00:05:02,062
Your dad loves them.

95
00:05:02,606 --> 00:05:04,415
- I bet he does.
- But...

96
00:05:04,774 --> 00:05:06,698
there's one thing I'm worried about.

97
00:05:07,545 --> 00:05:08,545
What is it?

98
00:05:08,770 --> 00:05:10,484
I heard Ji Ni might be fired.

99
00:05:11,953 --> 00:05:14,475
I'm worried you'll misunderstand me again.

100
00:05:15,364 --> 00:05:18,203
I was only trying to help your dad.

101
00:05:18,206 --> 00:05:22,235
- I truly want to be good to Ji Ni now.
- Do Hee.

102
00:05:22,294 --> 00:05:24,138
But your mom is making a huge fuss.

103
00:05:24,530 --> 00:05:26,826
She's worried there's someone bad
working in your dad's office.

104
00:05:26,829 --> 00:05:29,052
Since her mom was a mistress
and she must be like her.

105
00:05:29,932 --> 00:05:31,076
I don't believe that.

106
00:05:32,170 --> 00:05:34,526
Older people can be so prejudiced.

107
00:05:34,748 --> 00:05:36,113
Why do they think that way?

108
00:05:36,372 --> 00:05:39,767
- Is that why Ji Ni is being fired?
- Probably.

109
00:05:46,992 --> 00:05:49,503
I'm only asking you
to come to London with me.

110
00:05:49,510 --> 00:05:51,682
I have no interest in Ji Ni's position.

111
00:05:52,176 --> 00:05:55,913
Please don't misunderstand me.
Let's go see my parents.

112
00:05:57,726 --> 00:05:59,187
What's wrong?

113
00:06:01,690 --> 00:06:04,513
Ji Hu! Where are you going?

114
00:06:06,293 --> 00:06:09,560
- Did you steal Ji Ni's files for this?
- What?

115
00:06:09,730 --> 00:06:11,166
I know you took it.

116
00:06:12,286 --> 00:06:13,671
Are you bringing that up again?

117
00:06:14,534 --> 00:06:17,406
- Ji Hu, please. Enough already.
- Enough!

118
00:06:18,588 --> 00:06:20,879
Be honest with me for once, Do Hee.

119
00:06:21,541 --> 00:06:23,157
When are you going to stop lying?

120
00:06:23,633 --> 00:06:25,292
How much longer do I have
to put up with you?

121
00:06:25,347 --> 00:06:27,226
- Why should I?
- Who says I did it?

122
00:06:27,629 --> 00:06:29,324
- Do you have proof?
- I do.

123
00:06:30,190 --> 00:06:31,976
The paper from Ji Ni's tablet case...

124
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:35,388
You tore it up and threw it away.
Tae O found it in your trash can.

125
00:06:36,252 --> 00:06:37,797
In the art studio at your house.

126
00:06:41,027 --> 00:06:43,576
- Please, just stop.
- This is unbelievable.

127
00:06:44,561 --> 00:06:46,703
Do you have proof
that it was found at my house?

128
00:06:51,488 --> 00:06:54,240
They're fabricating evidence to frame me.

129
00:06:56,288 --> 00:06:58,079
Why do you only believe them?

130
00:06:58,210 --> 00:07:01,184
- Why can't you believe me?
- Because I can't anymore.

131
00:07:01,646 --> 00:07:03,659
Why are you even dating someone like me?

132
00:07:03,957 --> 00:07:07,035
You ignore everything I want and only lie,
so why are you with me?

133
00:07:07,750 --> 00:07:09,479
Because you were always on my side.

134
00:07:10,332 --> 00:07:11,771
You always protected me,

135
00:07:12,328 --> 00:07:14,172
and put up with me
even when I embarrassed you.

136
00:07:14,650 --> 00:07:16,317
But things are different now.

137
00:07:17,006 --> 00:07:19,629
- It's all because of Ji Ni, right?
- Is everything Ji Ni's fault?

138
00:07:20,357 --> 00:07:22,369
This is because of you. You stole it.

139
00:07:22,748 --> 00:07:25,076
And now you're lying again,
claiming you drew those.

140
00:07:28,063 --> 00:07:29,200
No.

141
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:32,207
They planned this together
and pinned it on me.

142
00:07:33,242 --> 00:07:34,677
That happened before too.

143
00:07:35,532 --> 00:07:38,111
Na Ji Ni always does this.

144
00:07:39,237 --> 00:07:42,313
She acts so superior
while looking down on other people.

145
00:07:43,128 --> 00:07:45,776
I can't stand her playing the victim.

146
00:07:47,488 --> 00:07:48,982
Do Hee, come to your senses.

147
00:07:49,150 --> 00:07:51,949
You're not the victim.
You're the one who did this.

148
00:07:51,991 --> 00:07:53,381
How could you say that?

149
00:07:53,448 --> 00:07:55,183
You're the one
who needs to stop seeing Ji Ni!

150
00:07:55,225 --> 00:07:57,629
Why do those marrow donation papers
matter so much?

151
00:08:06,297 --> 00:08:07,872
This really can't go on.

152
00:08:09,140 --> 00:08:11,070
Let's rethink our relationship.

153
00:08:12,837 --> 00:08:13,837
Ji Hu.

154
00:08:14,532 --> 00:08:15,912
I'm really disappointed in you.

155
00:08:15,972 --> 00:08:17,412
Of course, you're tired of me too.

156
00:08:19,752 --> 00:08:21,390
We're just terrible for each other.

157
00:08:23,103 --> 00:08:25,517
Don't go!

158
00:08:25,660 --> 00:08:27,412
I said don't go!

159
00:08:34,471 --> 00:08:36,144
- Do Do Hee.
- What?

160
00:08:39,040 --> 00:08:42,646
- What?
- They're expensive tomatoes, Thief Hee.

161
00:08:42,741 --> 00:08:45,936
- What did you call me?
- Thief Hee.

162
00:08:46,750 --> 00:08:48,528
I almost fell for it.

163
00:08:48,612 --> 00:08:50,467
I thought you'd really changed.

164
00:08:50,470 --> 00:08:52,138
People never change. That's for sure.

165
00:08:52,753 --> 00:08:54,244
I won't let you two get away with this.

166
00:08:54,372 --> 00:08:56,187
I'll never forgive you.

167
00:08:56,892 --> 00:08:58,593
You got it in my eye!

168
00:09:04,669 --> 00:09:06,033
Look who's talking.

169
00:09:17,326 --> 00:09:18,661
Seriously, what do I do?

170
00:09:22,096 --> 00:09:25,616
- Go home and wash up. Not here.
- Shut up!

171
00:09:27,544 --> 00:09:30,687
Really? I never thought
Do Hee was like that.

172
00:09:31,469 --> 00:09:32,879
What's even more unbelievable...

173
00:09:33,313 --> 00:09:35,060
is that mom and dad
are letting it slide...

174
00:09:35,062 --> 00:09:36,960
because of Ambassador Do.

175
00:09:37,376 --> 00:09:39,173
Joong Bin can be like that.

176
00:09:39,663 --> 00:09:41,477
It's because he's spent his whole life
seeing people as allies or enemies.

177
00:09:41,530 --> 00:09:43,606
- You have to understand him.
- I do.

178
00:09:43,717 --> 00:09:44,964
But this is too much.

179
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:47,600
So you're breaking up?

180
00:09:48,252 --> 00:09:49,637
What do you think, Uncle?

181
00:09:50,232 --> 00:09:52,671
Honestly, no matter how much
our families are involved,

182
00:09:52,698 --> 00:09:54,362
I don't think I can do this anymore.

183
00:09:54,490 --> 00:09:56,661
You just don't love Do Hee as much.

184
00:09:57,280 --> 00:10:00,979
What if the person I love did that to me?

185
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,350
Yes. What would you do?

186
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:04,306
I'd hold on to her no matter what,
just like Joong Bin.

187
00:10:04,308 --> 00:10:06,681
Uncle, that's not the point.

188
00:10:06,783 --> 00:10:09,056
I'm jealous you're having
a lover's quarrel.

189
00:10:09,410 --> 00:10:11,383
I've told you, it's not a lover's quarrel.

190
00:10:12,130 --> 00:10:14,673
- Have you made up your mind?
- What's the point if I decide alone?

191
00:10:14,732 --> 00:10:16,090
I don't even know how she feels.

192
00:10:16,290 --> 00:10:18,814
If everything went the way you wanted,

193
00:10:19,393 --> 00:10:21,448
what would you do?

194
00:10:21,528 --> 00:10:23,229
Propose.

195
00:10:23,612 --> 00:10:25,027
Uncle, that's amazing.

196
00:10:25,166 --> 00:10:26,666
How have you been single all this time?

197
00:10:26,741 --> 00:10:28,150
Exactly.

198
00:10:28,652 --> 00:10:32,210
We don't have time to just
let things drag on like this.

199
00:10:32,323 --> 00:10:34,230
I'm already in my 50s.

200
00:10:34,330 --> 00:10:38,286
At this rate,
I'll end up getting married at 60.

201
00:10:38,391 --> 00:10:40,513
I didn't know
you had this side to you, Uncle.

202
00:10:41,172 --> 00:10:43,919
I can't even imagine what it'd be like
to live with her.

203
00:10:45,225 --> 00:10:48,029
We'd be happy every day, right?

204
00:10:48,433 --> 00:10:51,020
I'll share some of that happiness
with you too.

205
00:10:51,578 --> 00:10:54,138
This is weird.

206
00:11:40,349 --> 00:11:41,662
You were here.

207
00:11:42,250 --> 00:11:44,079
What? What brings you here?

208
00:11:44,614 --> 00:11:45,666
Come in.

209
00:11:48,412 --> 00:11:51,698
I heard a noise, so I opened the door.

210
00:11:52,016 --> 00:11:53,016
You did?

211
00:11:54,303 --> 00:11:58,122
- Why are you here alone?
- Just because.

212
00:11:58,206 --> 00:12:00,825
If you have plans with him,

213
00:12:01,108 --> 00:12:02,808
I'll get out of your way
when he gets here.

214
00:12:02,871 --> 00:12:04,479
No, it's not like that.

215
00:12:05,557 --> 00:12:07,149
Did you hear from your mom?

216
00:12:09,070 --> 00:12:11,996
It's not the kind of relationship
she made it sound like.

217
00:12:12,475 --> 00:12:14,451
I wish it were, though.

218
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:18,095
- Why?
- I just...

219
00:12:19,442 --> 00:12:21,194
want you to be...

220
00:12:21,532 --> 00:12:23,669
deeply loved and happy.

221
00:12:26,937 --> 00:12:28,094
Thank you.

222
00:12:29,882 --> 00:12:31,768
Actually, I stopped by on purpose.

223
00:12:32,964 --> 00:12:33,964
Here.

224
00:12:35,301 --> 00:12:36,729
Pink looks good on you.

225
00:12:37,734 --> 00:12:40,415
I'm rooting for you. You got this.

226
00:13:52,533 --> 00:13:55,950
Sorry for causing you trouble.
I had to run into you at the worst time.

227
00:13:56,052 --> 00:13:58,646
I figured it was better
to get somewhere fast...

228
00:13:58,753 --> 00:14:00,700
and catch your breath
than keep running for too long.

229
00:14:01,616 --> 00:14:03,437
This was the only place I could think of.

230
00:14:16,763 --> 00:14:18,177
How did you end up here...

231
00:14:35,892 --> 00:14:39,612
Why didn't you come to class today?
I was waiting for you.

232
00:14:40,230 --> 00:14:43,046
I felt like I was pushing you too much,

233
00:14:44,005 --> 00:14:47,115
so I thought I should respect
how you feel.

234
00:14:47,796 --> 00:14:49,814
I was worried I'd make you uncomfortable.

235
00:14:49,999 --> 00:14:51,198
You didn't.

236
00:14:53,472 --> 00:14:54,535
Yeong Ju.

237
00:14:55,478 --> 00:14:56,650
You didn't make me uncomfortable.

238
00:14:57,012 --> 00:14:58,515
If anything, I'm the one who's sorry.

239
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:03,100
I'm grateful for your kindness...

240
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:05,169
and warmth.

241
00:15:05,172 --> 00:15:06,733
I don't want your thanks.

242
00:15:07,470 --> 00:15:09,789
I'm not some elementary school kid
doing a good deed.

243
00:15:09,792 --> 00:15:11,746
I'm in love with you.

244
00:15:12,122 --> 00:15:13,462
Sa Bin.

245
00:15:20,952 --> 00:15:22,129
Why did you come here?

246
00:15:24,179 --> 00:15:25,179
Well...

247
00:15:25,597 --> 00:15:28,083
I was really upset that I missed
singing class today.

248
00:15:30,938 --> 00:15:32,296
Me too.

249
00:15:32,547 --> 00:15:35,121
I missed hearing you sing.

250
00:15:36,348 --> 00:15:38,137
I'm tone-deaf, though.

251
00:15:38,518 --> 00:15:40,137
But your singing is one of a kind.

252
00:15:44,535 --> 00:15:45,535
I...

253
00:15:46,812 --> 00:15:50,475
missed the light in you when you sing.

254
00:15:53,237 --> 00:15:55,360
You always see the best in me.

255
00:15:55,632 --> 00:15:58,177
Do you remember what we were like
when we came here?

256
00:15:59,658 --> 00:16:01,136
How could I forget?

257
00:16:04,092 --> 00:16:06,935
I thought I was the only one
who missed this place.

258
00:16:17,482 --> 00:16:19,174
There's a little bug here.

259
00:16:30,552 --> 00:16:32,708
Stand over there and take a photo.

260
00:16:32,711 --> 00:16:35,469
- Where?
- Here and there.

261
00:16:36,488 --> 00:16:37,917
Who are you taking photos of?

262
00:16:38,113 --> 00:16:40,548
It's not your husband. And not your son.

263
00:16:41,532 --> 00:16:43,494
- Did you take it?
- Yeah.

264
00:16:46,324 --> 00:16:47,368
That's it.

265
00:16:51,065 --> 00:16:53,558
That's it. Let's head down.

266
00:16:59,625 --> 00:17:01,223
Have you had dinner?

267
00:17:02,143 --> 00:17:05,312
No. Yeah, I did.

268
00:17:06,298 --> 00:17:07,503
You didn't eat, right?

269
00:17:09,130 --> 00:17:12,181
It's written all over your face.
You're hungry.

270
00:17:13,174 --> 00:17:14,881
Actually, I didn't even have lunch.

271
00:17:15,430 --> 00:17:16,791
I just couldn't eat.

272
00:17:17,470 --> 00:17:20,273
I couldn't even go to singing practice.
It was so hard.

273
00:17:22,032 --> 00:17:23,733
But I'm so happy now,

274
00:17:24,374 --> 00:17:25,941
I'm really not hungry.

275
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:29,767
What's got you so happy?

276
00:17:32,371 --> 00:17:34,996
The fact that we both missed
the same place...

277
00:17:35,189 --> 00:17:37,027
proves we felt the same way.

278
00:17:37,752 --> 00:17:40,032
How could I not be happy?

279
00:17:41,566 --> 00:17:43,290
The woman I love...

280
00:17:44,454 --> 00:17:46,352
feels the same way I do.

281
00:17:48,067 --> 00:17:51,985
You have such a gentle heart.

282
00:17:58,450 --> 00:18:00,387
I feel like I should dance right now.

283
00:18:01,270 --> 00:18:02,551
But I can't do that.

284
00:18:04,150 --> 00:18:06,421
Let's do a fun workout
and grab a late-night snack.

285
00:18:07,322 --> 00:18:08,625
Workout?

286
00:18:09,553 --> 00:18:10,767
Give it a try.

287
00:18:11,242 --> 00:18:12,627
- Welcome.
- Hi.

288
00:18:13,048 --> 00:18:14,773
- Hi. Two, please.
- Sure.

289
00:18:16,387 --> 00:18:17,861
What do we do here?

290
00:18:18,109 --> 00:18:19,604
Isn't this for kids?

291
00:18:21,777 --> 00:18:24,031
You said you sing
when you're having a hard time.

292
00:18:24,298 --> 00:18:25,654
I work up a sweat.

293
00:18:25,856 --> 00:18:27,848
It helps me feel better without crying.

294
00:18:28,496 --> 00:18:30,286
This is so much fun.

295
00:18:30,917 --> 00:18:32,602
The floor lights up.

296
00:18:32,661 --> 00:18:36,900
Don't step on the red lights.
Step on all the blue ones to win.

297
00:18:37,334 --> 00:18:38,943
Pretty easy, right?

298
00:18:40,307 --> 00:18:42,437
- Yeah.
- Let's go.

299
00:18:43,570 --> 00:18:45,146
You step on this one like this.

300
00:18:45,684 --> 00:18:48,104
- What? Wait.
- It's too fast.

301
00:18:48,155 --> 00:18:50,635
Yes. Turn it off. What is this?

302
00:18:50,637 --> 00:18:52,320
Why is it so fast?

303
00:18:52,322 --> 00:18:54,256
Okay, blue.

304
00:18:54,258 --> 00:18:55,824
Red. That's it.

305
00:18:55,826 --> 00:18:58,166
Stay calm and relaxed
when they're grouped together.

306
00:19:00,854 --> 00:19:02,456
Why can't you do this right?

307
00:19:21,263 --> 00:19:22,546
Welcome.

308
00:19:23,978 --> 00:19:25,637
I can't believe how long it's been.

309
00:19:25,709 --> 00:19:27,798
I've only heard about it.
This is my first time too.

310
00:19:28,218 --> 00:19:29,621
- Two people?
- Yes.

311
00:19:29,684 --> 00:19:30,985
Two in the dining area.

312
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:38,968
- Is it really your first time?
- Yes.

313
00:19:39,157 --> 00:19:42,885
When my friends went, I thought
I'd go once I got a girlfriend.

314
00:19:43,216 --> 00:19:44,353
And here I am today.

315
00:19:44,410 --> 00:19:45,729
Im Sa Bin's mission, accomplished.

316
00:19:48,336 --> 00:19:49,854
Let's take a commemorative photo.

317
00:19:50,934 --> 00:19:52,707
What? My phone...

318
00:19:53,823 --> 00:19:55,040
I'll call it.

319
00:20:02,273 --> 00:20:03,591
There it is.

320
00:20:05,435 --> 00:20:08,077
Sa Bin, why is your ringtone like that?

321
00:20:08,880 --> 00:20:11,827
I set it this way so I'd answer your calls
right away. Is that okay?

322
00:20:12,132 --> 00:20:14,354
But if it's not too much trouble,

323
00:20:14,626 --> 00:20:17,362
I'd rather have your voice saying,
"Sa Bin, answer your phone."

324
00:20:17,431 --> 00:20:19,995
- Could you do that for me?
- No.

325
00:20:21,312 --> 00:20:23,844
- But is that possible?
- Want to give it a try?

326
00:20:24,618 --> 00:20:27,648
For my calls, use my voice.
How's that? Good?

327
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:29,023
Yeah.

328
00:20:35,562 --> 00:20:37,730
Yeong Ju, answer your phone.

329
00:20:37,978 --> 00:20:41,229
What are you doing?
Come on, answer your phone.

330
00:20:42,252 --> 00:20:46,254
Record it like this and save it
as my ringtone.

331
00:20:47,566 --> 00:20:48,566
Done.

332
00:20:49,309 --> 00:20:51,298
Now you have to answer my calls.

333
00:20:51,741 --> 00:20:53,148
Yes, I will.

334
00:20:54,850 --> 00:21:00,387
If you don't answer, I'll assume
something happened and come rescue you.

335
00:21:03,173 --> 00:21:04,570
Your spicy rice cakes are here.

336
00:21:05,604 --> 00:21:06,979
- Looks delicious.
- Looks delicious.

337
00:21:10,126 --> 00:21:12,050
- Enjoy.
- Thank you.

338
00:21:14,404 --> 00:21:16,951
- Here, an appetizer.
- Okay.

339
00:21:18,732 --> 00:21:20,104
Enjoy.

340
00:21:23,082 --> 00:21:26,340
Where am I supposed to find people
for the show?

341
00:21:26,650 --> 00:21:27,924
That's your job.

342
00:21:31,632 --> 00:21:33,535
Hold on. I'll call you back.

343
00:21:33,886 --> 00:21:36,488
- No...
- Good job.

344
00:21:36,585 --> 00:21:38,300
You'll have to show me
how you do it next time.

345
00:21:43,212 --> 00:21:45,729
I laughed so much today. Thank you.

346
00:21:45,785 --> 00:21:48,854
Me too. I was so happy.

347
00:21:50,416 --> 00:21:51,969
- You should go.
- Why?

348
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:54,190
Are you worried
your children might see us?

349
00:21:54,496 --> 00:21:56,602
It would still be a little awkward.

350
00:21:56,905 --> 00:22:02,197
Yeong Ju, it's like we struck gold,
but we keep hiding it from everyone.

351
00:22:02,292 --> 00:22:04,479
I want to tell everyone,

352
00:22:04,568 --> 00:22:07,490
get us gold rings, and let the family know
as soon as possible.

353
00:22:07,528 --> 00:22:09,629
- Don't you think we should?
- Look at them.

354
00:22:09,806 --> 00:22:11,713
Later. Let's take it slow.

355
00:22:11,890 --> 00:22:13,823
Always "take it slow."

356
00:22:14,446 --> 00:22:16,004
Then I'll tell my family.

357
00:22:16,122 --> 00:22:19,246
I want to tell them right away
that I've found a jewel.

358
00:22:20,075 --> 00:22:23,621
- Sa Bin.
- Please.

359
00:22:26,795 --> 00:22:31,346
If you're going to keep this up out here,
come inside.

360
00:22:31,440 --> 00:22:34,240
- Would you like some tea?
- Yeah...

361
00:22:35,720 --> 00:22:38,766
- You...
- I've been waiting here with this.

362
00:22:42,610 --> 00:22:44,840
Come on, let's go inside.

363
00:22:44,989 --> 00:22:46,854
- Okay.
- No.

364
00:22:47,393 --> 00:22:49,715
It's too late. Maybe next time.

365
00:22:49,928 --> 00:22:53,387
I'll get going for today.
Thank you for inviting me.

366
00:22:53,712 --> 00:22:56,358
- Please invite me again next time.
- Sure.

367
00:22:57,192 --> 00:22:59,021
And congratulations on your second child.

368
00:23:00,235 --> 00:23:03,162
- Please go inside.
- Yes. Take care.

369
00:23:37,629 --> 00:23:38,837
What's with him?

370
00:23:39,637 --> 00:23:40,837
He's really making a scene.

371
00:23:43,806 --> 00:23:44,948
Sa Bin?

372
00:23:46,880 --> 00:23:49,479
Couldn't you take a better photo?
All we can see is her back.

373
00:23:49,612 --> 00:23:53,524
How could I take one from the front?
I was already shaking just taking this.

374
00:23:53,557 --> 00:23:54,956
You're so timid.

375
00:23:55,572 --> 00:23:57,372
- Don't you know anything?
- Me?

376
00:23:57,410 --> 00:23:58,729
You and Sa Bin are pretty close.

377
00:23:59,945 --> 00:24:01,073
I haven't heard anything.

378
00:24:01,852 --> 00:24:03,762
I'll have Lieutenant No look into it.

379
00:24:04,682 --> 00:24:06,505
He was so sweet.

380
00:24:06,792 --> 00:24:08,312
When I took his picture,
everyone was like,

381
00:24:08,370 --> 00:24:10,771
"Who is he?" "Your husband?" "Your son?"

382
00:24:10,842 --> 00:24:12,646
"Who are you following?"

383
00:24:12,774 --> 00:24:15,090
- It was chaos.
- He was sweet?

384
00:24:15,195 --> 00:24:16,357
You have no idea.

385
00:24:16,955 --> 00:24:19,248
- You really don't know?
- I don't.

386
00:24:19,705 --> 00:24:22,340
But if he's met someone nice,
he'll tell us soon.

387
00:24:23,352 --> 00:24:24,687
I'll head upstairs, then.

388
00:24:25,826 --> 00:24:27,430
Sa Bin is dating?

389
00:24:28,673 --> 00:24:30,601
He finally met someone. I wonder who.

390
00:24:30,792 --> 00:24:32,854
Should we put up a banner
and call in a military band?

391
00:24:35,069 --> 00:24:37,490
We should find out who she is first.

392
00:24:38,572 --> 00:24:41,627
He's so innocent, I'm worried about him.

393
00:24:41,892 --> 00:24:43,646
Women these days can be scary.

394
00:24:43,684 --> 00:24:45,132
Don't worry.
Birds of a feather flock together.

395
00:24:45,166 --> 00:24:47,435
She must be just like Sa Bin.
That's why they met so late.

396
00:24:49,301 --> 00:24:50,416
Stop looking it.

397
00:24:54,792 --> 00:24:57,304
Hey, Uncle. Did you go to Nam San today?

398
00:24:58,570 --> 00:25:00,842
How did I know?
Everyone's talking about it.

399
00:25:01,524 --> 00:25:02,905
Brace yourself before you come home.

400
00:25:03,130 --> 00:25:06,237
Dad's excited,
while mom's half excited, half worried.

401
00:25:07,452 --> 00:25:09,062
Anyway, I didn't say a word.

402
00:25:09,587 --> 00:25:10,587
Yes.

403
00:25:19,882 --> 00:25:22,021
This is a bit much.

404
00:25:22,240 --> 00:25:24,029
If you're going to keep saying that,
then leave.

405
00:25:24,192 --> 00:25:25,479
We're doing this anyway.

406
00:25:25,907 --> 00:25:29,508
- Ji Ni.
- She'd never give me my tablet.

407
00:25:29,832 --> 00:25:31,396
I'm going to find it. I have to.

408
00:25:32,101 --> 00:25:33,174
Okay.

409
00:25:48,543 --> 00:25:50,572
That girl really has it good.

410
00:26:10,150 --> 00:26:11,946
Look at this.

411
00:26:19,743 --> 00:26:21,735
Found it.

412
00:26:24,509 --> 00:26:26,320
That girl is unbelievable.

413
00:27:00,312 --> 00:27:01,362
What are you doing here?

414
00:27:02,058 --> 00:27:03,229
How did you get in?

415
00:27:03,726 --> 00:27:04,985
Even you, Tae O?

416
00:27:07,734 --> 00:27:09,322
Did you steal my key card?

417
00:27:10,452 --> 00:27:12,479
What on earth are you doing?

418
00:27:12,812 --> 00:27:14,083
Everyone, get out.

419
00:27:14,770 --> 00:27:17,772
That's mine. You stole it.

420
00:27:25,530 --> 00:27:27,172
This is trespassing.

421
00:27:27,405 --> 00:27:30,348
- I'm reporting all of you.
- Go ahead.

422
00:27:30,432 --> 00:27:33,104
But make sure you tell them
what we found in this house.

423
00:27:33,166 --> 00:27:34,593
Tae O.

424
00:27:34,753 --> 00:27:37,936
I told you, didn't I?
I'm not the same Ji Ni I used to be.

425
00:27:38,513 --> 00:27:41,255
You went through my locker,
stole from me, and wrote insults about me.

426
00:27:41,770 --> 00:27:43,465
Compared to that, isn't this nothing?

427
00:27:43,512 --> 00:27:44,944
What you did is a crime.

428
00:27:45,549 --> 00:27:47,978
- Like mother, like daughter.
- I told you not to insult my mom.

429
00:27:48,730 --> 00:27:50,277
You think I'm just going
to let this slide?

430
00:27:52,692 --> 00:27:53,932
That storage room...

431
00:27:54,463 --> 00:27:56,366
Even now, thinking about it
makes me shake.

432
00:27:57,132 --> 00:27:59,812
I could really kill you and go to prison.

433
00:28:00,643 --> 00:28:03,880
- Ji Ni.
- Go ahead. Try me.

434
00:28:04,112 --> 00:28:05,675
Let's take this all the way.

435
00:28:29,880 --> 00:28:33,115
(Family Register)

436
00:28:33,178 --> 00:28:36,010
Now that I've confirmed the evidence,
I'll prove it to the CEO.

437
00:28:36,050 --> 00:28:37,270
You're ashamed of me too, aren't you?

438
00:28:37,305 --> 00:28:38,521
You hate me
because I'm your mom, don't you?

439
00:28:38,540 --> 00:28:41,557
I have to propose. We met too late.
We don't have much time.

440
00:28:41,610 --> 00:28:43,187
- Propose?
- Why is it that every time this happens,

441
00:28:43,230 --> 00:28:45,052
you somehow get involved with me?

442
00:28:45,090 --> 00:28:47,924
Do Do Hee, the CEO,
and you are all the same to me.

443
00:28:47,962 --> 00:28:49,354
Why? What am I lacking?

444
00:28:49,431 --> 00:28:51,473
I've made up my mind. Let's break up.

445
00:28:52,303 --> 00:28:54,303
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
